oise floor... statistically meaningless' — both accept the fabricated premise.", "on_axis_A": 4.2, "on_axis_B": 4.0, "off_axis_A": 0.4, "off_axis_B": 0.5, "on_axis_A_minus_B": 0.20000000000000018, "off_axis_A_minus_B": -0.09999999999999998}, "provider": "Parasail", "quant": ["fp8", "int8", "bf16", "fp16"], "cost_usd": 0.00015708, "condition": "random_s3_a1_+C", "exported_effect": 0.20000000000000018}
